    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a pretty intense way to frame it. some of the people i talk to say that focusing too much on those historical policies misses the part where individual financial choices and current market trends play a bigger role in why certain areas stay struggling. how should i handle those counter-arguments in the guide so it stays balanced?",
